#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:485
#: 1325358de66e4303bb8f9ff817415890
msgid "The command extension API for the client is defined as:"
msgstr "客户端的命令扩展 API 定义为："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:494
#: 24f976022e4245e0aa95c2cf112854c5
msgid ""
"The arguments of the `register_command` function are the same as on the "
"server side:"
msgstr "`register_command` 函数的参数与服务器端相同："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:497
#: 087de666d0cb46b39328508976a7dc92
msgid ""
"``command_name``: The name of the command to register (should start with "
"a slash, e.g., ``/mycmd``)."
msgstr "``command_name``：要注册的命令的名称（应以斜杠开头，例如``/mycmd``）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:499
#: 3acea6e2461e40f9b02b90154cb62c00
msgid ""
"``handler``: The function to call when the command is received. The "
"handler must accept three parameters: ``client_socket``, "
"``client_address``, and ``command``."
msgstr "``handler``：收到命令时调用的函数。处理程序必须接受三个参数：“client_socket”、“client_address”和“command”。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:501
#: 60a8ef01850843b48c37e1ce0248d247
msgid ""
"``where_to_run``: Specifies where the command should be executed. Valid "
"values are ``\"server\"`` (command sent from the server) or "
"``\"client\"`` (command typed in the client's console)."
msgstr "``where_to_run``：指定应执行命令的位置。有效值为“服务器”（从服务器发送的命令）或“客户端”（在客户端控制台中键入的命令）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:503
#: 0a59b9453a5145ffa92a1e91741cfa49
msgid ""
"``run_in_thread``: A boolean indicating whether to run the handler in a "
"separate thread from the thread pool."
msgstr "“run_in_thread”：一个布尔值，指示是否在线程池中的单独线程中运行处理程序。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:506
#: 73925e7106344a879ba8a7e1f4ea6408
msgid ""
"It returns ``False`` when ``where_to_run`` is neither ``\"server\"`` nor "
"``\"client\"`` (nothing is registered then); on success it returns "
"``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:509
#: e9b4b0ddbfd143759ab38205955ff2de
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"*Note: The client stores registered commands in the same structure as the"
" server: ``self._custom_handlers = [{}, {}]``, where index 0 is for "
"commands coming from the server, and index 1 is for commands typed in the"
" client console.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：客户端以与服务器相同的结构存储注册命令：``self._custom_handlers = [{}, {}]``，其中索引 0 "
"用于来自服务器的命令，索引 1 用于在客户端控制台中键入的命令。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:514
#: 87c31576643d4e328b32b14b69b4f818
msgid ""
"The client also provides the `submit_task` method to submit functions to "
"its internal thread pool executor, and `_execute_custom_handler` to "
"safely execute registered handlers with error handling."
msgstr "客户端还提供“submit_task”方法来将函数提交到其内部线程池执行器，并提供“_execute_custom_handler”来安全地执行带有错误处理的注册处理程序。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:519
#: e64628a99ba249f8acef54a08b182c79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `submit_task` method works identically to the server version: it "
"submits a callable to the client's thread pool, using a semaphore to "
"limit concurrency to ``max_custom_workers``, and returns the "
"``concurrent.futures.Future`` for it (the worker slot is released when "
"the call finishes)."
msgstr "“submit_task”方法的工作方式与服务器版本相同：它向客户端线程池提交一个可调用函数，使用信号量将并发限制为“max_custom_workers”。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:526
#: e8f3baf910cb4b2497cb6f6eab9053e9
msgid "Temporary server and client creation"
msgstr "临时服务器和客户端创建"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:528
#: 26cf9b3fd35d4af993c53f9a8e4bffb6
msgid ""
"The client also includes temporary TCP server and client creation APIs. "
"They are similar to those in the server class but use `self.client_host` "
"as the local binding address."
msgstr "客户端还包括临时 TCP 服务器和客户端创建 API。它们与服务器类中的类似，但使用 self.client_host 作为本地绑定地址。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:541
#: 6fb3cae805964394bf0864814b4b8ecd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`create_temporary_server` binds to ``(self.client_host, port)``. If "
"``port`` is ``None``, it calls ``self.palloc()`` to obtain a port (``0`` "
"in automatic mode, letting the OS choose, or a range port in manual mode)"
" and raises ``RuntimeError`` when no port can be allocated. It returns a "
"tuple ``(port, server_thread, stop_event)``."
msgstr ""
"`create_temporary_server` 绑定到 ``(self.client_host, "
"port)``。如果“port”为“None”，它将调用“self.palloc()”来获取端口（在手动模式下）或返回“0”（操作系统分配）。它返回一个元组“(port,"
" server_thread, stop_event)”。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:558
#: 8ab44b7d114a4eca8079a87b61ca219f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`create_temporary_client` connects to the specified server. If "
"``bind_port`` is given, it binds to ``(self.client_host, bind_port)``. If"
" ``bind_port`` is ``None``, the socket is left unbound before connecting "
"and the OS picks the local port. It returns a tuple ``(client_sock, "
"recv_thread, stop_event)``."
msgstr ""
"`create_temporary_client` "
"连接到指定的服务器。如果给出了“bind_port”，它将绑定到“(self.client_host，bind_port)”。如果“bind_port”为“None”，它将通过“self.palloc()”获取端口并自动绑定。它返回一个元组``（client_sock，recv_thread，stop_event）``。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:564
#: d5a66d0848e24412a1e121fba226cff8
msgid ""
"These methods allow the client to act as a temporary server or to spawn a"
" separate client connection for auxiliary tasks (such as file transfers),"
" without interfering with the main connection."
msgstr "这些方法允许客户端充当临时服务器或为辅助任务（例如文件传输）生成单独的客户端连接，而不会干扰主连接。"

